# Served by Cloudflare at the edge, not by Astro. This file is parsed by the
# Workers static-assets runtime and is never served as an asset itself.
#
# /blog was the post index before the post list moved to the home page. A real
# 301 replaces the <meta http-equiv="refresh"> page that used to live at
# src/pages/blog/index.astro: a meta refresh makes the browser load a page and
# bounce, and search engines treat it as a weaker signal than an HTTP redirect.
#
# Only the bare index redirects. /blog/<slug> must keep resolving, since that is
# where posts live.
/blog   /  301
/blog/  /  301
